## First question: what exactly is a "drawing action"?

Inspect REQUIREMENTS.md and the current application behavior.

Propose an explicit definition.

My initial expectation is that rate-limited drawing mutations should include
persistent Area mutations:

    CREATE
    UPDATE
    DELETE
    RESTORE
    RESTORE FROM HISTORY

Read-only operations should NOT consume the drawing-action limit:

    GET viewport areas
    GET version history
    GET health
    login/register

Frontend-only drawing operations should NOT consume backend rate limit:

    placing vertices
    moving vertices before Save
    live area calculation
    switching base maps
    opening History

The limiter should apply when the user attempts to persist a drawing-related
mutation.

If the repository/requirements indicate a different interpretation, explain
it before proposing implementation.

